    "text": "1. Select Courses\n\n2. Analyzing\n\n3. Review Changes\n\n4. Download & Sync\n\n5. Complete\n\nReview Changes\nHelp\nSelect the files you want to sync, and ignore the ones you don't need.\n11\nNew files\n6\nUpdates available\n2\nEdited locally\n4\nDeleted locally\n2\nDeleted on Canvas\nSmart Select\nBy filetype\n\nDOCX (all)\n\nHTML (all)\n\nJPG (all)\n\nJS (all)\n\nMD (none)\n\nPDF (6/8)\n\nTXT (3/6)\n\nSelect All\n\nDeselect All\n\n1.\nProgrammering og udvikling af små systemer samt databaser (LA)\nProgrammering og udvikling af små systemer samt databaser (LA E25 BINTO1064U)\n21 files pending sync\n192 files up to date\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nNew Files\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nUpdates Available\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nUpdates Available — You've Edited These\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nDeleted Locally\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nDeleted on Canvas (Kept Locally)\n\nkeyboard_arrow_right\n\nIgnored Files\n\n⚠️ 4 new files look like files you already have\nThese files are the same size and type as something already in your course folder, but the names are too different to be sure they are the same file &mdash; so they were not matched, and they are listed as new.<ul style='margin:8px 0 8px 18px; padding:0;'><li><b>Fiktiv Eksamensopgave3.pdf</b> &mdash; similar to <code>decoy 1 unrelated.pdf</code></li><li><b>forelæsningsnoter 13 OO UML.docx</b> &mdash; similar to <code>Uge 7 Forelæsning 13. Objekt orientering og Systemmodellering (use case model, domainModel)/zz omdøbt uden række 0.docx</code></li><li><b>Biblioteks_SSD_vejl.jpg</b> &mdash; similar to <code>Uge 9 Forelæsning 14. Design, Arkitektur/zz omdøbt uden række 1.jpg</code></li><li><b>Lecture 15 Database Design Exercises solutions NY.pdf</b> &mdash; similar to <code>decoy 0 unrelated.pdf</code></li></ul><b>What you can do:</b> leave them checked to download a fresh copy (your own files are never overwritten or deleted), uncheck one if you know you already have it, or use the eye icon to ignore it for good.\n\nGo back\n\nSync & Download 15 files",
